message: "If you reference this project in academic or educational work, cite it as below."
title: "Project Synapse v1: a single-channel EEG and subvocal-EMG acquisition instrument with variable-length gesture decoding"
abstract: >-
  An experimental, battery-isolated biological-signal acquisition chain: discrete
  instrumentation-amplifier front-end, 16-bit ADC sampled at 140 Hz by an Arduino Nano,
  a framed Bluetooth binary link, and a Python application that performs envelope
  autocorrelation segmentation, dynamic-time-warping template matching and a comparison of
  classical and deep-learning decoders. Not a medical device; no clinical validation.
